  On a fiber P (+) N is trivial, so w1(P) = w1(N) there and pi^* w2(X) = 0: o restricts to w1(N)^2 in both cases.

=== S3. An RP^2 inside one fiber of Met_(2,2) ===
  y_u = (2 u u^T - I_3) (+) (1); y_u = y_{-u}, so u -> y_u factors through RP^2.
