  u = (3/5, 4/5, 0): eigenvalues {-1: 2, 1: 2} (signature (2,2): True); P = Ru + Re4: True; N = u^perp in R^3: True
  u = (2/3, 2/3, 1/3): eigenvalues {1: 2, -1: 2} (signature (2,2): True); P = Ru + Re4: True; N = u^perp in R^3: True
  u = (0, 5/13, 12/13): eigenvalues {-1: 2, 1: 2} (signature (2,2): True); P = Ru + Re4: True; N = u^perp in R^3: True
  So on this RP^2, P = gamma (+) R and N = gamma^perp: w1(P) = w1(N) = a, and a^2 != 0 in H^2(RP^2; Z2).
  Hence o = pi^* w2(X) + w1(N)^2 (or + w1(P)^2) != 0 on every fiber: no Spin(7,7) structure on C over
